  "body": "\n\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n<nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n  <ol>\n    <li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"about.html\">Company</a></li><li><span aria-current=\"page\">For agencies</span></li>\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n    <div class=\"page-hero-side\" style=\"margin-top:1.5rem\">\n      <div>\n        \n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">For agencies</p>\n        <h1>Run every client's distribution without rebuilding the workflow each time.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Multi-client workspaces, saved routing presets and white-label reporting. The boring parts of agency distribution, done once.</p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"contact.html\">Request a workspace quote</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"testimonials.html\">Read agency reviews</a></div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section section-tight pt-0\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    \n    \n<div class=\"callout callout-answer\" data-reveal>\n  <strong>Quick answer</strong>\n  PressCosmos agency workspaces provide white-label distribution and reporting, isolated multi-client workspaces, saved routing presets, volume pricing from ten releases per month at 22% below list, and consolidated or pass-through billing. Agency clients never see PressCosmos branding on reports.\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Workflow</p>\n      <h2>What changes when you move agency distribution here</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bento\" data-stagger>\n    <article class=\"card b-2 spotlight\"><div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.4\"/><path d=\"M2.8 20a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 12.4 0\"/><path d=\"M16.5 5.2a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 0 6.4M18 20a6.5 6.5 0 0 0-2.2-4.9\"/></svg></div><h3>Client workspaces</h3><p>Isolated media lists, presets, users and reporting per client. No accidental cross-client asset sharing, and no separate logins to administer.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card b-2 spotlight\"><div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5-9 5-9-5z\"/><path d=\"m3.5 12.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/><path d=\"m3.5 16.6 8.5 4.7 8.5-4.7\"/></svg></div><h3>Routing presets</h3><p>Save a client's tier, verticals, metros and approval chain once, then reuse it. Agency teams typically halve submission time.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card b-2 spotlight\"><div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><path d=\"M14 3v5h5M9 13h6M9 17h4\"/></svg></div><h3>White-label reporting</h3><p>Your logo, colours and domain on shared report links. Includes the AI citation section clients ask about and competitors cannot show.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card b-2 spotlight\"><div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 7.5V12l3.2 2\"/></svg></div><h3>Approval chains</h3><p>Route through your client's legal or compliance reviewer without leaving the platform, with read receipts for the record.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"card b-4 spotlight\"><div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.4 2 5 13.4h5.4L9.8 22 18.5 10.5h-5.6z\"/></svg></div><h3>API and bulk submission</h3><p>Programmatic submission for high-volume accounts plus CSV bulk import, so a 40-client month does not become forty manual uploads.</p></article>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"section \">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head \" data-reveal>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">Economics</p>\n      <h2>What agencies usually save</h2>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g-3\">\n    \n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 17.5 9 11l4 4 8-8.5\"/><path d=\"M21 6.5v5h-5\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Margin on pass-through</h3>\n  <p>Distribution is billed per client at your rate. Volume pricing below list is where agency margin comes from.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 17.5 9 11l4 4 8-8.5\"/><path d=\"M21 6.5v5h-5\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Time recovered</h3>\n  <p>Presets, bulk import and saved approval chains remove the repetitive work from every submission.</p>\n  \n  \n</article>\n<article class=\"card spotlight\" data-reveal>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 17.5 9 11l4 4 8-8.5\"/><path d=\"M21 6.5v5h-5\"/></svg></div>\n  <h3>Retention evidence</h3>\n  <p>White-label reports with citation tracking give clients a reason to